# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout. Without a
# rule covering docker-compose.yml, a working copy converted to CRLF turns into
# a whole-file conflict (~920 lines) that can hide a real one-line regression —
# see SERV-52. text=auto still auto-detects binaries, so images and archives
# pass through untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit: shell scripts must be LF or the shebang line breaks under bash.
*.sh text eol=lf
